  "description": "Export naming probes (export-plan-compiler.md section 4, R-091, decision 093): filename groups holding an empty and a non-empty wildcard, a stray ')', three maps of one name (BaseColor, SpecularRoughness, Height), the case-only collision with the map order reversed, two exportList entries of one root, and a wildcard-free file name on two roots in both orders. Each probe step names an authored export configuration (the recorder's preset uzp_recorder, PNG 16, no dithering, infinite padding, root paths s0 and s1, changed as the probe says); the recorder lists it with list_project_textures and, when that succeeds, exports it, recording Painter's answer or refusal, the directory content and the files.",
